+
+The new construction uses the unchanged #5505 bank and all its real acquisition/release checks. Eight protected zero words are physically made from the current guide. One actual numerical result remains live until its lease closes; the encoded cursor advances only after retirement. All source bytes/head return, and all historical backing is counted across the complete tree. There are **78 owned roles plus the supplied source**.
+
+The quantified source-relative theorem covers every admitted dyadic, mixed-width axis source. It pays root count manufacture, each source seek and rewind, all cursor/level transitions, current guard preparation, actual numerical work, output lifetime and cleanup. Additional frontend work is at most `2^16(M+2)^2`, plus the sum of the inherited numerical Entry and bank tariffs over the d−1 nodes. The complete numerical-node traversal is `O(p^4)` for total address width at most p; owned retained storage is `O(p^2)` plus the entire supplied source backing, including older inaccessible tails.
